pp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The current element (a chunk).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/chunk_view","title":"std::ranges::views::chunk, std::ranges::chunk_view"},{"path":"ranges/chunk_view/outer_iterator","title":"std::ranges::chunk_view<V>::outer-iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ranges::chunk_view<V>::outer-iterator::operator*","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Returns the current chunk in the chunk_view."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The current element (a chunk)."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":66,"codeBlockCount":0}
